# Process artefacts, deliberately NOT published (they stay on disk, just untracked).
# `docs/decisions/` (ADRs) is the durable design record and IS committed. These are the working notes
# behind them — point-in-time plans and specs, full of real balances, holdings and statement narrations,
# and stale the moment the code moves on. See docs/decisions/README.md.
docs/superpowers/
.claude/plans/

# Vendored third-party agent skills (shadcn, Hono, Turborepo, Vercel, Better-Auth docs).
# Upstream content under upstream licences — reproducible from skills-lock.json, so it is not
# redistributed here. The lock file (source repo + path + content hash) IS committed.
.agents/skills/
